  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The town hall of Varginha, a town in Minas Gerais, Brazil, where residents said strange beings appeared in 1996, set up a museum about the event, according to Aldo Rebelo, a Brazilian politician who has served as defense minister. He tells Michels the town hall created it \"to acknowledge and value the phenomenon.\" In his telling, the local government itself treats the 1996 sightings as part of the town's history."
